  {
    "statement": "In agricultural contexts, no-tillage practices increase earthworm numbers compared to conventional tillage.",
    "citations": [
      "2306"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "In agricultural contexts, reduced tillage sometimes increases earthworm populations.",
